  "details": "Please enable the creation of worlds that are accessible on PC and Android but not iOS.\n\nWe request the implementation of a feature to remove \"converted world data\" from worlds automatically converted for iOS, making them accessible only on PC and Android as before.\n\nWorld creators without iOS devices face difficulties debugging their own worlds.\n\nWhile warnings appear when entering automatically converted worlds, many multinational users cannot read English, sometimes reporting bugs that cannot be fixed.\n\nSome world creators would rather not see their worlds broken by automatic conversion and would prefer to “only publish to PC and Android!” Please understand this.",
